Tooti Hai Kamar Kaise Bataun Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
mai Kaise Teri Laash Uthaun Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
1. Saber Ne Kaha Qabr Me Gar Izn Ataa Ho<br>
mai Aapko Yeh Nouha Sunaun Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
2. Uth-te Hi Nahi Mere Qadam Khaimou'n Ki Jaanib<br>
<br>
zainab Se Tujhe Kaise Milau'n Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
3. Abbas Ke Baazu Bhi Qalam Hogaye Ran Me<br>
<br>
ab Kisko Madad Karne Bulau'n Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
4. Zaqmi Tera Seena Toh Pidar Dekh Raha Hai<br>
<br>
mai Apna Jigar Kisko Dikhau'n Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
5. Ankho'n Se Dikhyi Nahi Deta Hai Pidar Ko<br>
<br>
mayyath Teri Lekar Kahan Jau'n Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
6. Mannat Toh Teri Paalne Waali Ki Badhadu'n<br>
sehra Tere Lashe Pe Sajau'n Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
7. Yeh Haal Tera Dekh Ke Marjaye Na Bano<br>
mai Kaise Tera Zaqm Chipau'n Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
8. Bete Ko Kafan Dena Fareeza Hai Pidar Ka<br>
<br>
yeh Qarz Magar Kaise Chukau'n Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
9. Sheh Bole Takallum Zara Beemaar Se Mil Lo<br>
<br>
kis Haal Me Sughra Hai Dikhau'n Ali Akbar